message: "If you use or reference this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Advisor OS: A Local-First macOS Workspace for Canadian Financial Advice and Lending Appointments"
abstract: >-
  Advisor OS treats the appointment as the unit of work for retail financial advisors and mortgage agents.
  It reads calendars already configured on the Mac through EventKit, attaches Canadian document checklists
  and agendas to each appointment, drafts bilingual client communications and compliance notes with Apple's
  on-device language model, and records every human approval in an audit trail. All data and inference
  remain on the device.
